  "about": "ENTITY-TYPE-CATALOG-1 - the Entity Type value shapes. The SAME file feeds value-shape.spec.ts (browser) and ValueShapesTest (Java); a case that passes on one side only would mark a column 'shape matches' in the picker while Add data proposes something else. Shapes are a CLOSED vocabulary: free, e164, digits(n|a-b), luhn(n|a-b), iban, email, uuid. digits(n) fits only WEAKLY (digits alone could be another number of that length); luhn(n) strongly. Every matcher is ASCII only: a no-break space is not trimmed, an Arabic-Indic digit is not a digit.",
